  "description": "This a resubmission of extant approved application no. 24/0555/GPH03, decision dated 25th April 2024.\n\nConfirmation is sought from the LPA that either prior approval is not required, or that prior approval is required and granted, for the proposed erection of a roof extension comprising one additional storey to the existing 3 storey terraced mixed-use building (comprising a Class E(a) Display/Sale of goods other than hot food) use on the ground floor with residential above) known as Canham House.\n\nThe proposed additional storey would create 3 additional residential units, comprising 1 x 1Bed/2Person unit and 2 x 2Bed/3 Person units. The gross internal area and room sizes of all proposed units would comply with the Nationally Described Space Standards.\n\n",
